GAL16V8
ADSCSIU4

GALCLK DRQ  ZA2  ZA3  ZA4  ZA5  BUSRST SEL  NC9  GND
OEGND ST7  U4P13 DMALED Q15  Q16  CS5380 DACK NC19 VCC

/ST7.R = /DMALED * /CS5380
    + ST7 * /Q15 * Q16 * CS5380 * DACK
    + /ST7 * /Q16 * CS5380
    + /ST7 * Q15 * CS5380

U4P13.T = /ZA4 * /SEL * U4P13 * CS5380
    + ZA2 * ZA3 * ZA4 * ZA5 * /CS5380
    + BUSRST * U4P13 * CS5380
    + ZA5 * BUSRST * U4P13
U4P13.E = VCC

/DMALED.T = BUSRST * /DMALED * CS5380
    + ZA2 * ZA3 * ZA4 * ZA5 * /SEL
    + /ZA2 * /ZA3 * /ZA4 * ZA5 * /SEL
    + ZA5 * BUSRST * /DMALED
DMALED.E = VCC

Q15.R = DRQ * CS5380

Q16.R = CS5380 * /DACK
    + Q15 * CS5380

CS5380.T = /ZA2 * ZA3 * ZA4 * ZA5
    + /ZA2 * /ZA3 * /ZA4 * ZA5
    + SEL
CS5380.E = VCC

/DACK.T = /ZA2 * ZA3 * ZA4 * ZA5 * BUSRST * /SEL * /DMALED * Q15 * Q16
    + ZA2 * ZA3 * ZA4 * ZA5 * /SEL * /ST7 * Q15 * Q16
    + ZA5 * BUSRST * /ST7 * Q15 * /DACK
    + BUSRST * SEL * /ST7 * /DMALED * Q15 * Q16
    + /ZA2 * /ZA3 * /ZA4 * ZA5 * /SEL * ST7 * /DACK
    + /ZA2 * /ZA3 * /ZA4 * ZA5 * /SEL * Q15 * Q16
    + /ZA2 * ZA3 * ZA4 * ZA5 * BUSRST * /SEL * ST7 * /DACK
DACK.E = VCC

NC19.T = GND
NC19.E = GND

DESCRIPTION

AdSCSI 2000 U4, equivalent equations fitted from the original chip's recorded behaviour (gals/u4). Pin names are the board nets measured on 2026-11-08 (schematic/netlist/gal_nets.csv).
